<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-096" chapter-id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd" source-id="s-jinshu-096-xun-wyd1916">
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA">荀崧</persName>小女<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0004" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAC">灌</persName>幼有奇節<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0009" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA">崧</persName>為襄城太守為<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0016" ref="4vd_pg5_o8x">杜曾</persName>所圍力弱食盡欲求救於故吏平南將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0034" ref="72y_aw4_2e4">石覽</persName>計無從出<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0040" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAC">灌</persName>時年十三乃率勇士數十人踰城突圍夜出賊追甚急<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0062" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAC">灌</persName>督厲將士且戰且前得入魯陽山獲免自詣<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0080" ref="72y_aw4_2e4">覽</persName>乞師又為<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0085" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA">崧</persName>書與南中郎將<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0092" ref="c6b_s71_vt7">周訪</persName>請援仍結為兄弟<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0101" ref="c6b_s71_vt7">訪</persName>即遣子<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0105" ref="smf_swf_i2l">撫</persName>率三千人會<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0111" ref="72y_aw4_2e4">石覽</persName>俱救<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0115" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA">崧</persName>賊聞兵至散走<persName id="c-jinshu-096-xunguan-wyd:p001:m0122" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAC">灌</persName>之力也</p>
</text>
